# Each entry is an intentional design choice; see docs/security.md.
# Internet-facing ALB is the public API entry point (ingress CIDRs are configurable).
AVD-AWS-0053
# Tasks need HTTPS egress to AWS APIs (Bedrock, SQS, Textract, ECR, Cognito JWKS) via NAT.
AVD-AWS-0104
# Default allowed_ingress_cidrs is 0.0.0.0/0 for a public API; restrict via terraform.tfvars.
AVD-AWS-0107
# Plain HTTP listener only serves traffic when no ACM certificate is configured (dev); with a
# certificate it redirects to HTTPS.
AVD-AWS-0054
